= Appendix E — Practical Skills Checklist

== E.1 Plan and prepare

+ Identify the participants, objectives, environment and required equipment.
+ Ask participants about access needs and appropriate adaptations.
+ Check the activity space and equipment; report hazards before starting.
+ Explain the activity, boundaries, signals and expected conduct.
+ Use a gradual warm-up suited to the activity and participants.

== E.2 Participate and review

+ Practise a movement in manageable steps with appropriate feedback.
+ Follow instructions and the rules relevant to the activity.
+ Stop and report concerning symptoms or unsafe conditions.
+ Allow recovery and use a suitable gradual cool-down when appropriate.
+ Review what was learned and what could be adapted next time.

These are educational checks, not a medical assessment or an emergency protocol. Seek appropriately qualified help for injuries or concerning symptoms.
